post.description:
Convert a workspace stored in an older sopc format with `sopc migrate`: the v0.0.8 format, or
`locked` (v0.0.9), which sopc no longer has. Returns the plan;
with `apply`, writes the converted files as a draft (publish to release them).

Write a proposed suggestion again against the procedure as it is now, keeping the edits made since it was
written. Returns the new suggestion (`generating`, `rewrite_of` this one; the model and sopc run as a job);
this one is dismissed. 409 unless it's proposed.

Connect a GitHub repository, or change the connection. Checks that the token can read the repository and the
branch and (unless `require_project` is false) that `path` on `base_branch` holds a sopc project (sopc.yaml);
the token is stored encrypted with SOPOPS_SECRET_KEY.
